bunny.garden.v1
# Garden 3: smashing. Pots stop a small bunny; a Jack smashes them. One
# corridor has a pot in every lane, and lettuce needs a Jack to eat.
name Potting Row
number 3
set 1
grid 20
spawn 0,0 1,0 at 3
shed 3,3
patrol 3,3 2,3 2,2 3,2
farmer walk 3.0 run 5.0 windup 0.5 chase 20 scatter 7 spook 8
par 200
bonus 1,1 2,1 at 6 C

